# Vercel deploys run from the repo root but upload ONLY the web app (web/). Everything at the root is excluded
# first, then web/ is re-included, then local and build files inside web/ are excluded again.
# Check before every deploy: `npm run deploy:check` (prints the upload list, fails on anything outside web/).
# Deploys always pass --environment preview (`npm run deploy:preview`); production only on the owner's word.
/*
!/web

/web/.env*
/web/.next
/web/node_modules
/web/out
/web/build
/web/coverage
/web/test-results
/web/playwright-report
/web/.vercel
/web/*.tsbuildinfo
/web/next-env.d.ts
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
